{"id":"8bfbf07c0a7ee61b","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-generalized-myhill.md","title":"可数分区的广义 Myhill 同构","display":"thm-generalized-myhill — 可数分区的广义 Myhill 同构","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-generalized-myhill","aliases":["20-thm-generalized-myhill"],"display":"thm-generalized-myhill — 可数分区的广义 Myhill 同构","chapter":"1","section":"1.7","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 1.7.7","source_printed_pages":[21],"source_pdf_pages":[57],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-generalized-myhill"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-generalized-myhill</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generalized-myhill — 可数分区的广义 Myhill 同构"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 1.7.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>21</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d6dc64668d77215\" href=\"?note=2d6dc64668d77215\" title=\"20-df-computable-isomorphism\">20-df-computable-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_n),(B_n)\">\\((A_n),(B_n)\\)</span> 各为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 的两两不交分区，未要求有效枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\">\\(f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\)</span> 为单射，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[A_n]\\subseteq B_n\">\\(f[A_n]\\subseteq B_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g[B_n]\\subseteq A_n\">\\(g[B_n]\\subseteq A_n\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2d6dc64668d77215\" href=\"?note=2d6dc64668d77215\" title=\"20-df-computable-isomorphism\">20-df-computable-isomorphism</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}myhill}\\vdash\n\\exists h\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(h)\\land\\forall n\\ h[A_n]=B_n].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}myhill}\\vdash\n\\exists h\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(h)\\land\\forall n\\ h[A_n]=B_n].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>交替让最小尚未匹配的左点、右点进入有限双射。左点 a 的候选 f(a) 若已被匹配，沿当前逆匹配到另一个左点，再应用 f；这些点处于同一分区块。单射 f 保证路径不能循环：首次起点不在有限匹配域中，重复必经逆推导致矛盾。有限已用点外终能找到新右点。反向步骤用 g 和当前匹配。全部操作只用 f、g 与有限表，无需判定分区块。极限是全可计算置换，保持全部块。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 1.7.7；印刷页 21；PDF 第 57 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(A_n),(B_n)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}","display":false},{"tex":"f[A_n]\\subseteq B_n","display":false},{"tex":"g[B_n]\\subseteq A_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}generalized\\text{-}myhill}\\vdash\n\\exists h\\in\\omega^\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{CompPerm}(h)\\land\\forall n\\ h[A_n]=B_n].","display":true}],"bytes":1612,"backlinks":[{"id":"7959e36d1026e950","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-acceptable-numbering]]；see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-injective-numbering-translation]]；see [[20-thm-generalized-myhill]]。"}],"outgoing":["2d6dc64668d77215","e343870c773cb68e"]}